{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19669","headline":"道州夏日早访荀参军林园敬酬见赠 · 吕温","name":"道州夏日早访荀参军林园敬酬见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高眠日出始开门，竹径旁通到後园。\n陶亮横琴空有意，任棠置水竟无言。\n松窗宿翠含风薄，槿援朝花带露繁。\n山郡本来车马少，更容相访莫辞喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}